  "title": "I Run My Entire Business From A $12 Server",
  "description": "My whole business runs on a $12 a month VPS instead of my laptop. A VPS (virtual private server) is a small cloud computer you rent, and once Claude Code is set up on it your projects keep running whether your laptop is open, closed, or packed away. I can open my entire operation from my phone anywhere in the world and voice a new prompt in seconds. Cheap plans start around $5 a month, and the Claude Code VPS setup is mostly just telling Claude Code to do it for you.\n\nGet the free VPS setup guide here: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1lPcGjgqbRDiuEI7mx84cutPdX7xxenf_wBvY5xZyUXA/edit?usp=sharing\n\nSubscribe for more no-fluff Claude Code and AI automation tips.\n#Shorts #ClaudeCode #AI",
